  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Above Crescent Lake she waits with Fairy Qing Suo and Fairy Fen Meng, standing apart from Gui Wang and Loner Hong Yu. The three are righteous path Gu Immortals who still collaborate with the two demonic path immortals for Immortal Gu recipes stored in Lang Ya blessed land. None of the five attackers holds an Immortal Gu; they use green grape immortal essence while draining the land’s white litchi immortal essence. After the land’s immortal essence is spent, she declares that Lang Ya blessed land’s immortal essence has been emptied, and she later says she is fortunate to see the twelve cloud buildings said to hold countless recipes.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crescent_lake",
        "char_fairy_qing_suo",
        "char_fairy_fen_meng",
        "char_gui_wang",
        "char_loner_hong_yu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_recipe",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a petite and fair girl wearing a yellow garment. She is beautiful and charming.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a delicate body.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit had shown weakness to draw the five immortals in, confined their rank five Gu, and took their submission. When Fang Yuan spends a refinement chance, the land spirit teleports the five over as support and, after a failed try, orders Fairy Huang Sha to steep tea for Fang Yuan. She becomes his serving maid, fetching celestial horse wine and destitute wine from the blessed land. She pleads for him to save her and promises lifelong service; he refuses, kicks her down, and breaks an incisor when she looks at him with resentment. Her rank five Gu have already been taken, her immortal essence is spent, and the blessed land suppresses her. Fang Yuan recalls that in his previous life these five immortals all died in Lang Ya blessed land as cannon fodder for greed and impulse. Fairy Fen Meng and Fairy Qing Suo, normally close to her like sisters, stay silent when the land spirit offers Fang Yuan leave to play with her.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-at-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan declines that offer, the weight in her heart lifts and her hatred of Fang Yuan and the land spirit deepens; she swears that if she escapes she will cut their bodies into a thousand pieces.",
      "chapters": [
        465
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-at-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later sees the three Hua Hai immortals among familiar captive faces held by Lang Ya land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        744
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-captivity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hua_hai_three_immortals"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He counts the three Hua Hai immortals among four Gu Immortal captives left to him and states that they cultivate wood path. He puts the three into a deal that lets Heavenly Lord Bai Zu change bids at an auction; the seller takes the three Hua Hai immortals as wood path immortal apertures useful to cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        763
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-captivity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_heavenly_lord_bai_zu"
      ]
    }
  ],
